{"availability":"available","full":"85599/KJStockScreener","name":"KJStockScreener","description":"   AI-native NSE stock screener — breakouts, live option chain & AI trading agent, built with Streamlit","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":10,"forks":4,"created":"2026-08-31T08:25:27Z","updated":"2026-10-08T04:38:45Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://kjstockscreener.streamlit.app/","topics":["ai-agents","algo-trading-tool","dhanhq","indian-stock-market","kite-connect","llm","nse","python","stock-screener","streamlit","technical-analysis","trading-bot","zerodha"],"demo":"https://hub.docker.com/r/callmejainsahab/kjstockscreener","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:30.508Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:30.508Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:30.508Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:57.571Z","stars":10,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:22:56.457Z","stars":10,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-11T04:28:44.200Z","stars":10,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:30.508Z","stars":10,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Find breakouts. Chat with an AI trading agent. Explore company fundamentals. Track live option chains. All in one Streamlit app.","KJStockScreener is a Python + Streamlit screener for NSE (India) stocks that goes beyond a typical breakout scanner. On top of a classic multi-threaded technical screening engine (breakouts, consolidation, RSI, moving-average crossovers, candlestick patterns), it adds an AI-native trading agent, a live NSE option chain viewer, an ML-based Nifty gap-up/gap-down predictor, and LedgerLens — a built-in fundamentals explorer that pulls a company's full financials, ratios, and filings straight from screener.in — all inside one self-contained web app.","Whether you want to run a classic rule-based scan in two clicks, or ask a chatbot in plain English to \"find me swing setups in Nifty 500 with RSI between 50 and 65,\" KJStockScreener has a mode for it."],"features":["Multi-process, multi-threaded scanning across NSE indices (Nifty 50 up to Nifty 500 / F&O universe)","Breakout & consolidation detection with configurable lookback and volume-ratio filters","Candlestick pattern recognition (Bullish/Bearish Engulfing, Inside Bar, Momentum Gainer, and more)","MA/EMA crossover signals (50/200 Golden Cross, support/resistance zones)","RSI-based reversal screening (9-SMA of RSI)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/85599/KJStockScreener/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b35c8239a182722599148f0d597d7d98b1420512c00875ca1b8fcfaa772073fb","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:29:41.344Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:30.613Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Find breakouts. Chat with an AI trading agent. Explore company fundamentals. Track live option chains. All in one Streamlit app.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/85599/KJStockScreener/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b35c8239a182722599148f0d597d7d98b1420512c00875ca1b8fcfaa772073fb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/85599/KJStockScreener/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:30.614Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T04:38:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/85599/KJStockScreener/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:30.614Z","hash":"b35c8239a182722599148f0d597d7d98b1420512c00875ca1b8fcfaa772073fb","originalBytes":10271,"storedBytes":10271,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:30.508Z","subjects":["MCP servers & agents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["MCP servers & agents"],"evidence":[{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"agent"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automation & workflows","Apple","Chatbots & assistants","Data